### 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "kim1234",
  "password": "pas",
  "nickName": "철수"
}

### 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "kim1234",
  "password": "password123",
  "nickName": "철수"
}

### 로그인 - 성공 (200 + Set-Cookie)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "kim1234",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 로그인 - 비번 틀림 (401)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "kim1234",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### 로그인 - 없는 아이디 (401)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "nobody",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 로그인 - 빈칸 (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "",
  "password": ""
}

### 내 정보 - 로그인 후 (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/auth/me

### 내 정보 - 쿠키 없이 (401)
# @no-cookie-jar
GET http://localhost:8080/auth/me

### CSRF 쪽지 받기
GET http://localhost:8080/csrf

> {%
    // 응답의 Set-Cookie 중에서 XSRF-TOKEN=... 줄을 찾아서, 값만 xsrf 변수에 저장
    const line = response.headers.valuesOf("Set-Cookie").find(c => c.startsWith("XSRF-TOKEN="));
    client.global.set("xsrf", line.split(";")[0].substring("XSRF-TOKEN=".length));
%}

### 로그인 - 쪽지 없이 (403이어야 함)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "kim1234",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 로그인 - 쪽지 넣어서 (200)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}

{
  "userName": "kim1234",
  "password": "password123"
}

